cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "syndicate-genesis: a GitHub template for self-governing research syndicates"
message: >-
  If you use this template, or a syndicate generated from it, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  # No ORCID is listed. The manifest ships placeholder ORCIDs, and a placeholder
  # identifier in a citation file is worse than none: it resolves to nothing and
  # reads as a real claim. Add yours here when you add it to syndicate.yaml, not
  # before. The guard checks this file for the placeholder pattern, so it is not
  # written out here either.
  - family-names: Maino
    given-names: Nicholas Clifford
    alias: bigDSanalyst
repository-code: "https://github.com/bigDSanalyst/syndicate-genesis"
abstract: >-
  A GitHub template that turns a repository into a self-governing research
  collective: git-native attribution from the commit and review record, a
  consortium agreement executed by pull request against a content hash, and
  priority proofs anchored to Bitcoin through OpenTimestamps. No external
  platform, no token, and no account beyond GitHub is required.
keywords:
  - research infrastructure
  - attribution
  - provenance
  - open science
  - OpenTimestamps
  - reproducible research
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/bigDSanalyst/syndicate-genesis/blob/main/LICENSE"
date-released: "2026-09-02"

# Cite the template. The instances are the evidence that it runs, not separate
# works: syndicate-shakedown carries the executed agreement and the anchor
# chain, syndicate-sim carries the first ratified attribution window.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "syndicate-shakedown: cold-start instance of syndicate-genesis"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/bigDSanalyst/syndicate-shakedown"
    authors:
      - family-names: Maino
        given-names: Nicholas Clifford
        alias: bigDSanalyst
  - type: software
    title: "syndicate-sim: week-one simulation of the syndicate-genesis protocol"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/bigDSanalyst/syndicate-sim"
    authors:
      - family-names: Maino
        given-names: Nicholas Clifford
        alias: bigDSanalyst
